  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sahel Humanitarian Assistance and Protection Programme - Bridging Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide life-saving assistance to crisis-affected and vulnerable people across five Sahelian countries, Mali, Niger, Chad, Mauritania and Burkina Faso. This support includes assistance for those suffering from food insecurity, therapeutic food and early detection of severe acute malnutrition, basic support to livelihoods through the provision of seeds and tools, animal food and animal vaccinations, improved access to safe water and hygiene, and emergency health and medicine.</narrative>
  </description>
